{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"○歷三","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"△授時歷經上","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"步氣朔第一","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"至元十八年歲次辛巳為元。上考往古，下验將來，皆距立元為算。周歲消長，百年各一。其諸應等數，隨時推测，不用為元。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"日周，一萬。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"歲實，三百六十五萬二千四百二十五分。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"通餘，五萬二千四百二十五分。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"朔實，二十九萬五千三百五分九十三秒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"通閏，十萬八千七百五十三分八十四秒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"歲周，三百六十五日二千四百二十五分。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"朔策，二十九日五千三百五分九十三秒。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"氣策，十五日二千一百八十四分三十七秒半。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"望策，十四日七千六百五十二分九十六秒半。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"絃策，七日三千八百二十六分四十八秒少。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"氣應，五十五萬○六百分。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"閏應，二十萬一千八百五十分。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"按《授時歷》閏轉交三應，後有改定之數。閏應，二十萬一千八百五十分，明《大統歷法通軌》作二十萬二千五十分，實加二百分；是當時經朔改早二刻也。轉應，一十三萬一千九百四分，《通軌》作一十三萬二百五分，實减一千六百九十九分，是入轉改遲一十七刻弱也。交應，二十六萬一百八十七分八十六秒，《通軌》作二十六萬三百八十八分，實加二百分一十四秒，是正交改早二刻強也。梅文鼎謂《通軌》所述者乃《授時歷》續定之數，而《歷經》所存，則其未定之初稿是也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"没限，七千八百一十五分六十二秒半。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"氣盈，二千一百八十四分三十七秒半。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"朔虛，四千六百九十四分七秒。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"旬周，六十萬。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"紀法，六十。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推天正冬至","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置所求距算，以歲實上推往古，每百年長一。下算將求，每百年消一。乘之，為中積。加氣應，為通積。滿旬周，去之；不盡，以日周約之為日，不滿為分。其日命甲子算外，即所求天王冬至日辰及分。如上考者，以氣應减中積，滿旬周，去之；不盡，以减旬周。餘同上。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求次氣","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置天正冬至日分，以氣策累加之，其日滿紀法，去之，外命如前，各得次氣日辰及分秒。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推天正經朔","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置中積，加閏應，為閏積。滿朔實，去之，不晝為閏餘，以减通積，為朔積。滿旬周，去之，不盡，以日周約之，為日，不滿為分，即所求天正經朔日及分秒。上考者，以閏應减中積，滿朔實，去之不盡，以减朔實，為閏餘。以日周約之為日，不滿為分，以减冬至日及分，不及减者，加紀法减之，命如上。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求絃望及次朔","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置天正經朔日及分秒，以絃策累加之，其日滿紀法，去之，各得絃望及次朔日及分秒。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推没日","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置有没之氣分秒，如没限已上為有没之氣。以十五乘之，用减氣策，餘滿氣盈而一，為日，併恒氣日，命為没日。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推滅日","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置有滅之朔分秒，在朔虛分已下為有滅之朔。以三十乘之，滿朔虛而一，為日，併經朔日，命為滅日。步發斂第二","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"土王策，三日四百三十六分八十七秒半。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"月閏，九千六十二分八十二秒。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"辰法，一萬。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"半辰法，五千。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"刻法，一千二百。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推五行用事","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"各以四立之節，為春木、夏火、秋金、冬水首用事日。以土王策减四季中氣，各得其季土始用事日。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"氣候正月","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"立春，正月節。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"東風解冻，蟄虫始振，魚陟負冰。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"雨水，正月中。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"獭祭魚，候雁北，草木萌動。二月","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"驚蟄，二月節。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"桃始華，仓庚鳴，鷹化為鳩。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"春分，二月中。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"玄鳥至，雷乃發聲，始電。三月","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"清明，三月節。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"桐始華，田鼠化為鴽，虹始見。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"穀雨，三月中。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"萍始生，鳴鳩拂其羽，戴勝降於桑。四月","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"立夏，四月節。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"蝼蟈呜，蚯蚓出，王瓜生。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"小滿，四月中","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"苦菜秀，靡草死，麥秋至。五月","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"芒种，五月節。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"螳螂生，貝鳥始鳴，反舌無聲。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"夏至，五月中。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"鹿角解，蜩始鳴，半夏生。六月","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"小暑，六月節。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"溫風至，蟋蟀居壁，鷹始挚。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"大暑，六月中。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"腐草為螢，土润溽暑，大雨時行。七月","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"立秋，七月節。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"涼風至，白露降，寒蝉呜。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"處暑，七月中。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"鷹乃祭鳥，天地始肅，禾乃登。八月","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"白露，八月節。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"鸿雁來，立鳥歸，群鳥養羞。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"秋分，八月中。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"雷始收聲，蟄虫坏戶，水始涸。九月","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"寒露，九月節。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"鸿雁來賓，雀入大水為蛤，菊有黃華。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"霜降，九月中。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"豺乃祭獸，草木黃落，蟄虫鹹俯。十月","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"立冬，十月節。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"水始冰，地始冻，雉入大水為蜃。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"小雪，十月中。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"虹藏不見，天氣上升，地氣下降，閉塞而成冬。十一月","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"大雪，十一月節。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"鶡旦鳥不鳴，虎始交，荔挺出。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"冬至，十一月中。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"蚯蚓結，麋角解，水泉動。十二月","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"小寒，十二月節。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"雁北乡，鵲始巢，雉句雅。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"大寒，十二月中。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"雞乳，征鳥厲疾，水泽腹堅。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推中氣去經朔","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置天正閏餘，以曰周約之，為日，命之，得冬至去經朔。以月閏累加之，各得中氣去經朔日算。滿朔策，去之，乃全置閏，然俟定朔無中氣者裁之。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推發斂加時","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置所求分秒，以十二乘之，滿辰法而一，為辰數。餘以刻法收之，為刻。命子正算外，即所在辰刻。如滿半辰法，通作一作辰，命起子初。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"步日躔第三","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"周天分，三百六十五萬二千五百七十五分。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"周天，三百六十五度二十五分七十五秒。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"半周天，一百八十二度六十二分八十七秒半。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"象限，九十一度三十一分四十三秒太。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"歲差，一分五十秒。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"周應，三百一十五萬一千七十五分。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"半歲周，一百八十二日六千二百一十二分半。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"盈初縮末限，八十八日九千九十二分少。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"縮初盈末限，九十三日七千一百二十分少。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推天正經朔絃望入盈縮歷","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置半歲周，以閏餘日及分减之，即得天正經朔入盈縮歷。冬至後盈，夏至後縮。以絃策累加之，各得絃望及次朔入盈縮歷日及分秒。滿半歲周去之，即交盈縮。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求盈縮差","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"视入限盈者，在盈初縮末限已下，為初限，已上，反减半歲周，餘為末限；縮者，在縮初盈末限已下，為初限，已上，反减半歲周，餘為末限。其盈初縮末者，置立差三十一，以初末限乘之，加平差二萬四千六百，又以初末限乘之，用减定差五百一十三萬三千二百，餘再以初末限乘之，滿亿為度，不滿退除為分秒。縮初盈末者，置立差二十七，以初末限乘之，加平差二萬二千一百，又以初末限乘之，用减定差四百八十七萬六百，餘再以初末限乘之，滿亿為度，不滿退限為分秒，即所求盈縮差。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"又術：置入限分，以其日盈縮分乘之，萬約為分，加其下盈縮積，萬約為度，不滿為分秒，亦得所求盈縮差。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"赤過宿度","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"角十二一十","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"亢九二十","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"氐十六三十","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"房五六十","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"心六五十","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"尾十九一十","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"箕十四十","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"右東方七宿，七十九度二十分。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"斗二十五二十","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"牛七二十","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"女十一三十五","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"虛八九十五太","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"危十五四十","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"室十七一十","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"壁八六十","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"右北方七宿，九十三度八十分太。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"奎十六六十","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"娄十一八十","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"胃十五六","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"昴十一三十","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"畢十七四十","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"觜初五","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"參十一一十","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"右西方七宿，八十三度八十五分。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"井三十三三十","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"鬼二二十","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"柳十三三十","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"星六三十","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"張十七二十五","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"翼十八七十五","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"軫十七三十","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"右南方七宿，一百八度四十分。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"右赤道宿次，併依新製浑儀测定，用為常數，校天為密。若考往古，即用當時宿度為准。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推冬至赤道日度。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置中積，以加周應為通積，滿周天分，上推往古，每百年消一。下算將來，每百年長一。去之，不盡，以日周約之為度；不滿，退約為分秒。命起赤道虛宿六度外，去之，至不滿宿。即所求天正冬至加時日躔赤道宿度及分秒。上考者，以周應减中積，滿周天，去之，不盡，以减周天，餘以日周之為度；餘同上。如當時有宿度，止依當時宿度命之。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求四正赤道日度","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置天正冬至加時赤道日度，累加象限，滿赤道宿次，去之，各得春夏秋正日所在宿度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求四正赤道宿積度","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置四正赤道宿全度，以四正赤道日度及分减之，餘為距後度。以赤道宿度累加之，各得四正後赤道宿積度及分。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"黃赤道率","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推黃道宿度","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推黃道宿度","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置四正後赤道宿積度，以其赤道積度减之，餘以黃道率乘之，如赤道率而一。所得，以加黃道積度，為二十八宿黃道積度。以前宿黃道積度减之，為其宿黃道度及分。其秒就近為分。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"黃道宿度","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"角十二八十七","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"亢九五十九","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"氐十六四十","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"房五四十八","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"心六二十七","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"尾十七九十五","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"箕九五十九","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"右東方七宿，七十八度一十二分。","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"斗二十三四十七","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"牛六九十","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"女十一一十二","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"虛九分空太","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"危十五九十五","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"室十八三十二","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_169","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"壁九三十四","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"右北方七宿，七十四度一十分太。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"奎十七八十七","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"娄十二三十六","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"胃十五八十一","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"昴十一○八","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"畢十五六十","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"觜初○五","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"參十二十八","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"右西方七宿，八十三度九十五分。","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"井三十一○三","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"鬼二一十一","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"柳十三","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_182","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"星六三十一","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"張十七七十九","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_184","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"翼二十○九","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"軫十八七十五","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"右南方七宿，一百九度八分","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"右黃道宿度，依今歷所漢赤道准冬至歲差所在算定，以凭推步。若上下考验，據歲差每移一度，依術推变，各得當時宿度。","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推冬至加時黃道日度","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置天正冬至加時赤道日度，以其赤道積度减之，餘以黃道卒乘之，如赤道率而一。所得，以加黃道積度，即所求年天正冬至加時黃道日度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求四正加時黃道日度","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置所求年冬至日躔黃赤道差，與次年黃赤道差相减，餘四而一，所得，加象限，為四正定象度。置冬至加時黃道日度，以四正定象度累加之，滿黃道宿次，去之，各得四正定氣加時黃道宿度及分。","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求四正晨前訛夜半日度","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置四正恒氣日及分秒，冬夏二至，盈縮之端，以恒為宿。以盈縮差命為日分，盈减朔加之，即為四正定氣日及分。置日下分，以其日行度乘之，如日周而一。所得，以减四正加時黃道日度，各得四正定晨前夜半日度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求四正後每日晨前夜半黃道日度","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"以四正定氣日距後正定氣日為相距日，以四正定氣晨前夜半日度距後正定氣晨前夜半日度為相距度，累計相距日之行定度。與相距度相减，餘如相距日而一，為日差。相距度多為加，相距度少為减。以加减四正每日行度率，為每日行定度。累加四正晨前夜半黃道日度，滿宿次，去之，為每日晨前夜半黃道日度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求每日午中黃道日度","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_197","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置其日行定度，半之，以加其日晨前夜半黃道日度，得午中黃道日度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求每日午中黃道積度","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"以二至加時黃道日度距所求日午中黃道日度，為二至後黃道積度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_200","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求每日午中赤道日度","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置所求日午中黃道積度，滿象限，去之，餘為分後。內减黃道積度，以赤道率乘之，如黃道率而一。所得，以加赤道積度及所去象限，為所求赤道積度及分秒。以二至赤道日度加而命之，即每日午中赤道日度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"黃道十二次宿度","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"危，十二度六十四分九十一秒。入娶訾之次，辰在亥。","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"奎，一度七十三分六十三秒。入降娄之次，辰在戌。","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"胃，三度七十四分五十六秒。入大梁之次，辰在酉。","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"畢，六度八十八分五秒。入實沈之次，辰在申。","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"井，八度三十四分九十四秒。入鶉首之次，辰在未。","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"柳，三度八十六分八十秒。入鶉火之次，辰在午。","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"張，十五度三十六分六秒。入鶉尾之次，辰在巳。","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"軫，十度七分九十七秒。入寿星之次，辰在辰。","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"氐，一度一十四分五十二秒。入大火之次，辰在卯。","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"尾，三度一分一十五秒。入析木之次，辰在寅。","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_213","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"斗，二度七十六分八十五秒。入星紀之次，辰在丑。","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"女，二度六分三十八秒。入玄枵之次，辰在子。","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求入十二次時刻","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"各置入次宿度及分秒，以其日晨前夜半日度减之，餘以日周乘之，為實。以其日行定度為法，實加法而一，所得，依發斂加時求之，即入次時刻。","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"步月離第四","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"轉終分，二十七萬五千五百四十六分。","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"轉終，二十七日五千五百四十六分。","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"轉中，十三日七千七百七十三分。","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"初限，八十四。","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"中限，一百六十八。","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"周限，三百三十六。","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"月平行，十三度三十六分八十七秒半。","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"轉差，一日九千七百五十九分九十三秒。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"絃策，七日三千八百二十六分四十八秒少。","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"上絃，九十一度三十一分四十三秒太。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"望，一百八十二度六十二分八十七秒半。","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"下絃，二百七十三度九十四分三十一秒少。","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"轉應，一十三萬一千九百四分。","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推天正經朔入轉","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置中積，加轉應，减閏餘。滿轉終分，去之，不盡，以日周約之為日，不滿為分，即天正經朔入轉日及分。上考者，中積內加所求閏餘，减轉應，滿轉終，去之，不盡，以减轉終，餘同上。","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求絃塑及次朔入轉","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置天正經朔入轉日及分，以絃策累加之，滿轉終，去之，即絃望及次朔入轉日及分秒。如径求次朔，以轉差加之。","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求經朔絃望入遲疾歷","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"各视入轉日及分秒。在轉中已下，為疾歷。已上，减去轉中，為遲歷。","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"遲疾轉定及積度","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求遲疾差","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置遲疾歷日及分，以十二限二十分乘之，在初限已下為初限，已上覆减中限，餘為末限。置立差三百二十五，以初末限乘之，加平差二萬八千一百，又以初末限乘之，用减定差一千一百一十一萬，餘再以初末限乘之，滿亿為度，不滿退除為分秒，即遲疾差。","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"又術：置遲疾歷日及分，以遲疾歷日率减之，餘以其下損益分乘之。如八百二十而一，益加損减其下遲疾度，亦為所求遲疾差","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求朔絃望定日","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"以經縮絃望盈縮差與遲疾差，同名相從，異名相消，盈遲縮疾為同名，盈疾縮遲為異名。以八百二十乘之，以所入遲疾限下行度除之，即為加减差，盈遲為加，縮疾為减。以加减經朔絃望日及分，即定朔絃塑日及分。若定絃望分在日出分已下者，退一日，其日命甲子算外，各得定朔絃望日辰。定朔幹名與後朔幹同者，其月大。不同者，其月小。內無中氣者，為閏月。","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推定朔絃望加時日月宿度","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置經朔絃望入盈縮歷日及分，以加减差加减之，為定朔絃望入歷，在盈，便為中積，在縮，加半歲周，為中積。命日為度，以盈縮差盈加縮减之，為加時定積度。以冬至加時日躔黃道縮度加而命之，各得定朔絃望加時日度。凡合朔加時，日月同度，便為定朔加時月度。其絃望各以絃望度加定積，為定絃望月行定積度。依上加而命之，各得定絃望加時黃道月度。","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推定朔絃望加時赤道月度","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"各置定朔絃望加時黃道月行定積度，滿象限，去之，以其黃道積度减之，餘以赤道率乘之，如黃道率而一，用加其下赤道積度及所去象限，各為赤道加時定積度。以冬至加時赤道日度加而命之，各為定朔絃望加時赤道月度及分秒。象限以下及半周，去之，為至後。滿象限以及三象，去之，為分後。","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推朔後平交入轉遲疾歷","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置交終日及分，內减經朔交日及分，為朔後平交日。以加經朔入轉，為朔後平交入轉。在轉中已下，為疾歷。已上，去之，為遲歷。","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求正交日辰","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_250","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置經朔，加朔後平交日，以遲疾歷依前求到遲疾差，遲加疾减之，為正交日及分，其日命甲子算外，即王交日辰。","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推正交加時黃道月度","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置朔後平交日，以月平行度乘之，為距後度。以加經朔中積，為冬至距正交定積度。以冬至日躔黃道宿度加而命之，為正交加時月離黃道宿度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求正交在二至後初末限","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置冬至距正交積度及分，在半歲周已下，為冬至後。已上，去之，為夏至後。其二至後，在象限已下，為初限。已上，减去半歲周，為末限。","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_255","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求定差距差定限度","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置初末限度，以十四度六十六分乘之，如象限而一，為定差。反减十四度六十六分，餘為距差。以二十四乘定差，如十四度六十六分而一。所得，交在冬至後名减，夏至後名加，皆加减九十八度，為定限度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求四正赤道宿度","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_258","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置冬至加時赤道度，命為冬至正度。以象限累加之，各得春分、夏至、秋分正積度。各命赤道宿次去之，為四正赤道宿度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_259","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求月離赤道正交宿度","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"以距差加减春秋二正赤道宿度，為月離赤道正交宿度及分秒。冬至後，初限加，末限减，视春正。夏至後，初限减，末限加，视秋正。","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_261","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求正交後赤道宿積度入初末限","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"各置春秋三正赤道所當宿全度及分，以月離赤道五交宿度及分减之，餘為正交後積度。以赤道宿次累加之，滿象限去之，為半交後。又去之，為中交後。再去之，為半交後。视各交積度在半象已下，為初限。已上，用减象限，餘為末限。","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_263","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求月離赤道正交後半交日道舊名九道。出入赤道內外度及定差","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置各交定差度及分，以二十五乘之，如六十一而一。所得，视月離設道下交在冬至後宿度為减，夏至後宿度為加，皆加减二十三度九十分。為月離赤道後半交白道出入赤道內外度及分。以周天六之一，六十度八十七分六十二秒半，除之，為定差。月離赤道正交後為外，中交後為內。","sentenceOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_265","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求月離出入赤道內外白過去極度","sentenceOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_266","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置每日月離赤道交後初末限，用减象限，餘為白道積。用其積度减之，餘以其差率乘之，所得，百約之，以加其下積差，為每日積差。用减周天六之一，餘以定差乘之，為每日月離赤道內外度。內减外加象限，為每日月離白道去極度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_267","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求每交月離白道積度及宿次","sentenceOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置定限度，與初末限相减相乘，退位為分，為定差。正交、中交後為加，半交後為减。以差加减正交後赤道積度，為月離白道定積度。以前宿白道定積度减之，各得月離白道宿次及分。","sentenceOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_269","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"推定朔絃望加時月離白道宿度","sentenceOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_270","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"各以月離赤道正交宿度距所求定期絃望加時月離赤道宿茂，為正交後積度。滿象限，去之，為半交後。又去之，為中交後。再去之，為半交後。视交後積度在半象已下，為初限。已上，用减象限，為末限。以初、末限與定限度相减相乘，退位為分，分滿百為度，為定差。正交、中交後為加，半交後為减。以差加减月離赤道正交後積度，為定積度。以正交宿度加之，以其所當月離白道宿次去之，各得定朔絃望加時月離白道度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_271","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求定朔望加時及夜半晨昏入轉","sentenceOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_272","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置經朔絃望入轉日及分，以定朔絃望加减差加减之，為定朔絃望加時入轉。以定朔絃望日下分减之，為夜半入轉。以晨分加之，為晨轉。昏分加之，為昏轉。","sentenceOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_273","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求夜半月度","sentenceOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_274","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置定朔絃望日下分，以其入轉日轉定度乘之，萬約為加時轉度，以减加時定積度，餘為夜半定積度，依前加而命之，各得夜半月離宿度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_275","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"求晨昏月度","sentenceOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_276","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"置其日晨昏分，以夜半入轉日轉定度乘之，萬約為晨昏轉度。各加夜半定積度。為晨昏定積度。加命如前，各得晨昏月離宿度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_36_277","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_36","textTraditional":"累計相距日數轉定度，為轉積度，與定朔絃望晨昏宿次前後相距度相减，餘以相减日數除之，為日差。距度多為加，距度少為减。以加减每日轉定度，以累加定朔絃望晨昏月度，加命，即每日晨昏月離白道宿次。朔後用昏，望後用晨，朔望晨昏俱用。","sentenceOrder":277}],"overrides":{}}